       Identification Division.                                         00010099
       Program-ID. F115L060.                                            00020099
       Author.  Hallvard Barman.                                        00030099
      *################################################################*00040099
      *                                                                 00050099
      * FD Trade Finance                                                00060099
      *                                                                 00070099
      *                                                                 00080099
      * Copy area, Listing/Computation of sum total of charges.         00090099
      *                                                                 00100099
      * If part amount no is supplied, all charges are read from        00110099
      * table TF_Part_Charge. Else, all charges are read from table     00120099
      * TF_Main_Charge.                                                 00130099
      *                                                                 00140099
      * NB! This module presents figures exactly as they appear from    00150099
      * one and only one of the two database tables. If you need        00160099
      * modified figures for settlement or for presentation to the      00170099
      * end user, use module F115L070!                                  00180099
      *                                                                 00190099
      *################################################################*00200099
      * Date ! Si! Change description                            ! 3A ! 00210099
      *------+---+-----------------------------------------------+----+ 00220099
      *111212!NDL! Guarantiees                                        ! 00230099
      *------+---+-----------------------------------------------+----+ 00231099
      *191001!NDL! Don't read charges from MC if earlier used    !LO18! 00232099
      *------+---+-----------------------------------------------+----+ 00240099
      *170901!NDL! Agent Commision - Feilretting                 !LO18! 00250099
      *------+---+-----------------------------------------------+----+ 00260099
      *280601!NDL! Current-orig-Amount instead of Remain-Amount  !LO18! 00270099
      *------+---+-----------------------------------------------+----+ 00280099
      *111200!LG ! Ws-Charge-Amount 3 --> 2 decimals             !LG10! 00290099
      *------+---+-----------------------------------------------+----+ 00300099
      *100599!HB ! New module                                    !LG10! 00310099
      *################################################################*00320099
       Environment Division.                                            00330099
       Configuration Section.                                           00340099
       Special-Names.                                                   00350099
           Decimal-Point Is Comma.                                      00360099
