       Data Division.                                                   00390099
       Working-Storage Section.                                         00400099
      *                                                                 00410099
       01  W-IO-Length                   Pic S9(04)              Comp.  00420099
      *                                                                 00430099
       01  WS-Fields.                                                   00440099
      *                                                                 00450099
           05  WS-Ind                    Pic S9(02)              Comp.  00460099
           05  WS-Count-Charges          Pic S9(04)              Comp.  00470099
           05  WS-Count-Rows             Pic S9(04)              Comp.  00480099
           05  WS-Contract-Range         Pic  X(20).                    00490099
             88  SW-Coll                        Value 'COLL-R'.         00500099
             88  SW-Imp-LC                      Value 'IMP-LC-R'.       00510099
             88  SW-Exp-LC                      Value 'EXP-LC-R'.       00520099
             88  SW-Gar                         Value 'GAR-R'.          00521099
      *                                                                 00530099
           05  WS-In-Charge-Type         Pic  X(20).                    00540099
           05  WS-In-Role-Type           Pic  X(20).                    00550099
           05  WS-CA-Or-PA-Amount        Pic S9(14)V9(03)        Comp-3.00560099
           05  WS-Display-Amount      Pic zzzzz9999999999v99.           00570099
      *                                                                 00580099
           05  WS-Read.                                                 00590099
               10  WS-No-Read            Pic S9(04)              Comp.  00600099
               10  WS-Read-From          Pic S9(04)              Comp.  00610099
               10  WS-Read-To            Pic S9(04)              Comp.  00620099
               10  WS-Excluded-Charges   Pic S9(04)              Comp.  00630099
               10  WS-Difference         Pic S9(04)              Comp.  00640099
      *                                                                 00650099
           05  WS-Charge.                                               00660099
               10  WS-Charge-Type        Pic  X(20).                    00670099
               10  WS-Role-Type          Pic  X(20).                    00680099
                 88  WS-Seller                Value 'DRWER', 'BENEF'.   00690099
                 88  WS-Buyer                 Value 'DRWEE', 'ISSUI',   00700099
                                                    'CUSTM'.            00710099
                 88  WS-Agent                 Value '     '.            00720099
               10  WS-Charge-Amount      Pic S9(14)V9(02)        Comp-3.00730099
               10  WS-Converted-Amount   Pic S9(14)V9(03)        Comp-3.00740099
               10  WS-Currency           Pic  X(03).                    00750099
               10  WS-Percent            Pic S9(03)V9(03)        Comp-3.00760099
               10  WS-Charge-Text        Pic  X(30).                    00761099
      *                                                                 00770099
           05  WS-Charge-Totals-Seller.                                 00780099
      *      10  WS-Ch-Seller-Cred-Agent Pic S9(14)V9(03)        Comp-3.00790099
             10  WS-Ch-Seller-Cred-T-Bank Pic S9(14)V9(03)       Comp-3.00800099
             10  WS-Ch-Seller-Cred-W-Bank Pic S9(14)V9(03)       Comp-3.00810099
             10  WS-Tot-Charge-Seller    Pic S9(14)V9(03)        Comp-3.00820099
      *                                                                 00830099
