             88  SW-PA-Checked                Value 'Y'.                00950099
             88  SW-PA-Not-Checked            Value 'N'.                00960099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*00970099
      * Internal area:                                                  00980099
      *                                                                 00990099
       01  W-Int-IO-Area.                                               01000099
           Copy R115L060.                                               01010099
      *                                                                 01020099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01030099
      * Assorted copy-areas:                                            01040099
      *                                                                 01050099
       01  Filler.                                                      01060099
      *                                                                 01070099
      * DBI TF_Contract_Amount.                                         01080099
           Copy R115ICA0.                                               01090099
      *                                                                 01100099
      * DBI TF_Main_Charge.                                             01110099
           Copy R115ICH0.                                               01120099
      *                                                                 01130099
      * DBI TF_Sys_Charge_Rel.                                          01140099
      *    Copy R115ICR0.                                               01150099
      *                                                                 01160099
      * DBI TF_Sys_Charge_Type.                                         01170099
           Copy R115ICT0.                                               01180099
      *                                                                 01190099
      * DBI TF_Part_Amount.                                             01200099
           Copy R115IPA0.                                               01210099
      *                                                                 01220099
      * DBI TF_Part_Charge.                                             01230099
           Copy R115IPC0.                                               01240099
      *                                                                 01250099
      * DBI TF_Sys_Code_Rel.                                            01260099
           Copy R115ISR0.                                               01270099
      *                                                                 01280099
      * LMOD TF/POP.                                                    01290099
           Copy R115L150.                                               01300099
      *                                                                 01310099
      * LMOD VA Converting amounts of money between currencies.         01320099
           Copy R116L030.                                               01330099
      *                                                                 01340099
      * GSM Get error message.                                          01350099
       01  Filler.                                                      01360099
           Copy R7918030.                                               01370099
      *                                                                 01380099
      * GSM Timestamp.                                                  01390099
           Copy R7919070.                                               01400099
      *                                                                 01410099
      * External data.                                                  01420099
       Copy R115X000.                                                   01430099
      *                                                                 01440099
      *################################################################.01450099
       Linkage Section.                                                 01460099
      *                                                                 01470099
       01  L-Ext-IO-Area                 Pic  X(11328).                 01480099
      *                                                                 01490099
      * Error handling.                                                 01500099
       Copy R7919999.                                                   01510099
      *                                                                 01520099
      *################################################################.01530099
       Procedure Division                Using L-Ext-IO-Area            01540099
                                               R7919999-Error-Area.     01550099
      *                                                                 01560099
       A000-Main.                                                       01570099
      *                                                                 01580099
           Perform B000-Initialize                                      01590099
      *                                                                 01600099
           Perform ZI00-Konv-Input-Version                              01610099
           Perform C000-Interface                                       01620099
           Perform ZO00-Konv-Output-Version                             01630099
      *                                                                 01640099
           Goback                                                       01650099
           .                                                            01660099
      *################################################################*01670099
       B000-Initialize.                                                 01680099
      *                                                                 01690099
           Set   R7919999-Return-OK      To    True                     01700099
           Initialize                          WS-Fields                01710099
           Set   SW-PA-Not-Checked       To    True                     01720099
      *                                                                 01730099
      * Get timestamp.                                                  01740099
      *                                                                 01750099
           Initialize                          R7919070-Timestamp       01760099
           Set   R7919070-Versjon        To    True                     01770099
           Call  'F7919070'              Using R7919070-Timestamp       01780099
                                               R7919999-Error           01790099
           End-Call                                                     01800099
           If  Not R7919999-Retur-OK                                    01810099
               Move  'B001'              To    R7919999-Paragraf        01820099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       01830099
           End-If                                                       01840099
           .                                                            01850099
      *################################################################.01860099
       C000-Interface.                                                  01870099
      *                                                                 01880099
           Perform C100-Control-Input                                   01890099
           Perform C200-Initialize-Output                               01900099
      *                                                                 01910099
      * Finding the contract range.                                     01920099
      *    Perform C300-Read-Sys-Code-Rel                               01930099
      *                                                                 01940099
      * Finding the contract Type.                                      01950099
           Perform C300-Set-Contract-Type                               01960099
      *                                                                 01970099
      * Finding the Contract Amount Currency.                           01980099
           Perform C400-Read-Contract-Amount                            01990099
      *                                                                 02000099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*02010099
      *                                                                 02020099
           If R115L060-In-Operation-Type =    'SHOW'                    02030099
      *                                                                 02040099
      * Read all charges.                                               02050099
             Perform G000-Read-All-Charges                              02060099
      *                                                                 02070099
           Else                                                         02080099
      *                                                                 02090099
      * Read all charges which are permissible given the operation type.02100099
             Perform D000-Read-Permissible-Charges                      02110099
      *                                                                 02120099
           End-If                                                       02130099
      *                                                                 02140099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*02150099
      *                                                                 02160099
      * When the charges have been read, the totals are made available. 02170099
      *                                                                 02180099
           If  WS-Read-To                =     WS-No-Read               02190099
             Perform J200-Output-Totals                                 02200099
           End-If                                                       02210099
           .                                                            02220099
      *################################################################.02230099
       C100-Control-Input.                                              02240099
      *                                                                 02250099
           If  R115L060-In-Work                                         02260099
           and R115L060-In-Operation-Type =    'SHOW'                   02270099
             Initialize                     R7918030-ErrorMessage       02280099
             Move  'TF-SY-SHOW-WORK-TAB-INVALID'                        02290099
                                         To R7918030-In-MessageCode     02300099
             Perform Z000-Error-Message                                 02310099
             Move  'C001'                To R7919999-Paragraph          02320099
             Perform Z700-Error-AE                                      02330099
           End-If                                                       02340099
           .                                                            02350099
      *################################################################.02360099
       C200-Initialize-Output.                                          02370099
      *                                                                 02380099
           Initialize                          R115L060-Data            02390099
      *                                                                 02400099
           Compute                             R115L060-Max-Tab-Occ     02410099
               =  ( Length               of    R115L060-Charge-Tab      02420099
               -    Length               of    R115L060-Max-Tab-Occ     02430099
               -    Length               of    R115L060-No-Tab-Occ     )02440099
               /  ( Length               of    R115L060-Charge-Element )02450099
           End-Compute                                                  02460099
           .                                                            02470099
      *################################################################*02480099
       C300-Set-Contract-Type.                                          02490099
      *                                                                 02500099
           Evaluate True                                                02510099
             When R115L060-In-Contract-Type  =                          02520099
                  'IDP' Or 'IDA' Or 'ICP' Or 'ICA' Or 'EDP' Or 'EDA' Or 02530099
                  'ECP' Or 'ECA'                                        02540099
               Set Sw-Coll                    To  True                  02550099
             When R115L060-In-Contract-Type   = 'ILC' Or 'ILU'          02560099
               Set Sw-Imp-LC                  To  True                  02570099
             When R115L060-In-Contract-Type   = 'ELC' Or 'ECC'          02580099
               Set Sw-Exp-LC                  To  True                  02590099
             When R115L060-In-Contract-Type   = 'ILG' Or 'ELG'          02591099
               Set Sw-Gar                     To  True                  02592099
             When Other                                                 02600099
               Move  'C301'                   To  R7919999-Paragraph    02610099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       02620099
           End-Evaluate                                                 02630099
      *                                                                 02640099
           .                                                            02650099
      *################################################################*02660099
      *C300-Read-Sys-Code-Rel.                                          02670099
      *                                                                 02680099
      * Filling out DBI call parameters.                                02690099
      *                                                                 02700099
      *    Initialize                        R115ISR0-Sys-Code-Rel      02710099
      *    Set   R115ISR0-Version        To  True                       02720099
      *    Set   R115ISR0-In-Get-1st     To  True                       02730099
      *                                                                 02740099
      *    Move  R115L060-In-Fin-Inst-ID To  R115ISR0-In-F-I-ID         02750099
      *    Move  R115L060-In-Fin-Inst-No To  R115ISR0-In-F-I-No         02760099
      *                                                                 02770099
      *    Move  'CONTRACT-TYPE'         To  R115ISR0-In-From-ST-Type   02780099
      *    Move  Spaces                  To  R115ISR0-In-From-Contr-Type02790099
      *    Move  R115L060-In-Contract-Type                              02800099
      *                                  To  R115ISR0-In-From-SC-Code   02810099
      *                                                                 02820099
      *    Move  'CONTRACT-RANGE'        To  R115ISR0-In-To-ST-Type     02830099
      *    Move  Spaces                  To  R115ISR0-In-To-Contr-Type  02840099
      *    Move  '*'                     To  R115ISR0-In-To-SC-Code     02850099
      *                                                                 02860099
      *    Move  'VALID-CT-CR'           To  R115ISR0-In-Relation-Type  02870099
      *                                                                 02880099
      *    Perform C530-Call-DBI-TF-SR                                  02890099
      *                                                                 02900099
      *    Move  R115ISR0-To-SC-Code     To  WS-Contract-Range          02910099
      *    .                                                            02920099
      *################################################################*02930099
       C400-Read-Contract-Amount.                                       02940099
      *                                                                 02950099
      * Finding the main currency.                                      02960099
      *                                                                 02970099
           Initialize                          R115ICA0-Contract-Amount 02980099
           Set   R115ICA0-Version        To    True                     02990099
           Set   R115ICA0-In-Get-1st     To    True                     03000099
      *                                                                 03010099
           Evaluate True                                                03020099
             When R115L060-In-Actual                                    03030099
               Set R115ICA0-In-Actual    To    True                     03040099
             When R115L060-In-Work                                      03050099
               Set R115ICA0-In-Work      To    True                     03060099
           End-Evaluate                                                 03070099
      *                                                                 03080099
           Move  R115L060-In-Fin-Inst-ID To    R115ICA0-In-Fin-Inst-ID  03090099
           Move  R115L060-In-Fin-Inst-No To    R115ICA0-In-Fin-Inst-No  03100099
           Move  R115L060-In-Contract-Type                              03110099
                                         To    R115ICA0-In-Contract-Type03120099
           Move  R115L060-In-Contract-No To    R115ICA0-In-Contract-No  03130099
           Move  '*'                     To    R115ICA0-In-Currency     03140099
      *                                                                 03150099
           Call  'F115ICA0'              Using R115ICA0-Contract-Amount 03160099
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      03170099
           End-Call                                                     03180099
      *                                                                 03190099
           Evaluate True                                                03200099
             When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 03210099
               Move  'C201'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       03220099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       03230099
      *                                                                 03240099
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 03250099
               Move  'C202'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       03260099
               Perform Z700-Error-AE                                    03270099
      *                                                                 03280099
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    03290099
               Continue                                                 03300099
      *                                                                 03310099
           End-Evaluate                                                 03320099
           .                                                            03330099
      *################################################################.03340099
       C500-Read-Sys-Code-Rel.                                          03350099
      *                                                                 03360099
      * Filling out DBI call parameters.                                03370099
      *                                                                 03380099
           Initialize                        R115ISR0-Sys-Code-Rel      03390099
           Set   R115ISR0-Version        To  True                       03400099
      *                                                                 03410099
           Move  R115L060-In-Fin-Inst-ID To  R115ISR0-In-F-I-ID         03420099
           Move  R115L060-In-Fin-Inst-No To  R115ISR0-In-F-I-No         03430099
      *                                                                 03440099
           Move  'OPERATION-TYPE'        To  R115ISR0-In-From-ST-Type   03450099
           Move  Spaces                  To  R115ISR0-In-From-Contr-Type03460099
           Move  R115L060-In-Operation-Type                             03470099
                                         To  R115ISR0-In-From-SC-Code   03480099
      *                                                                 03490099
           Move  'CHARGE'                To  R115ISR0-In-To-ST-Type     03500099
           Move  Spaces                  To  R115ISR0-In-To-Contr-Type  03510099
           Move  '*'                     To  R115ISR0-In-To-SC-Code     03520099
      *                                                                 03530099
           Move  'VALID-OP-CHARGE'       To  R115ISR0-In-Relation-Type  03540099
      *                                                                 03550099
      * Reading the first permissible charge type.                      03560099
      *                                                                 03570099
           Perform C510-Read-1st-TF-SR                                  03580099
           .                                                            03590099
      *################################################################.03600099
       C510-Read-1st-TF-SR.                                             03610099
      *                                                                 03620099
      * Reading the first table row and counting the total              03630099
      * number of table rows.                                           03640099
      *                                                                 03650099
           Set   R115ISR0-In-CC-Count    To    True                     03660099
           Set   R115ISR0-In-Get-1st     To    True                     03670099
           Perform C530-Call-DBI-TF-SR                                  03680099
      *                                                                 03690099
           Move  R115ISR0-Out-Total-Rows To    WS-No-Read               03700099
           Perform I000-Adjust-Parameters                               03710099
           .                                                            03720099
      *################################################################.03730099
       C520-Read-Next-TF-SR.                                            03740099
      *                                                                 03750099
      * Reading the next permissible charge type.                       03760099
      *                                                                 03770099
           Set   R115ISR0-In-Get-Next    To    True                     03780099
           Perform C530-Call-DBI-TF-SR                                  03790099
           .                                                            03800099
      *################################################################.03810099
       C530-Call-DBI-TF-SR.                                             03820099
      *                                                                 03830099
           Call  'F115ISR0'              Using R115ISR0-Sys-Code-Rel    03840099
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      03850099
           End-Call                                                     03860099
      *                                                                 03870099
           Evaluate True                                                03880099
             When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 03890099
               Move  'C531'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       03900099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       03910099
      *                                                                 03920099
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 03930099
               Continue                                                 03940099
      *                                                                 03950099
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    03960099
               Continue                                                 03970099
      *                                                                 03980099
           End-Evaluate                                                 03990099
           .                                                            04000099
      *################################################################*04010099
      *C600-Read-Sys-Charge-Relation.                                   04020099
      *                                                                 04030099
      *    Initialize                          R115ICR0-Sys-Charge-Rel  04040099
      *    Set   R115ICR0-Version        To    True                     04050099
      *                                                                 04060099
      *    Move  R115L060-In-Fin-Inst-No To    R115ICR0-In-Fin-Inst-No  04070099
      *    Move  R115L060-In-Fin-Inst-ID To    R115ICR0-In-Fin-Inst-ID  04080099
      *                                                                 04090099
      *    Move  'CONTRACT-RANGE'        To    R115ICR0-In-From-ST-Type 04100099
      *    Move  WS-Contract-Range       To    R115ICR0-In-From-SC-Code 04110099
      *                                                                 04120099
      *    Move  'RELATED-PARTY'         To    R115ICR0-In-To-ST-Type   04130099
      *    Move  '*'                     To    R115ICR0-In-To-SC-Code   04140099
      *                                                                 04150099
      *    Move  WS-In-Charge-Type       To    R115ICR0-In-Charge-Type  04160099
      *                                                                 04170099
      *    Perform C610-Read-1st-TF-CR                                  04180099
      *    .                                                            04190099
      *################################################################*04200099
      *C610-Read-1st-TF-CR.                                             04210099
      *                                                                 04220099
      *    Set   R115ICR0-In-Get-1st     To    True                     04230099
      *    Set   R115ICR0-In-CC-Count    To    True                     04240099
      *    Perform C630-Call-DBI-TF-CR                                  04250099
      *                                                                 04260099
      *    Evaluate R115ICR0-Out-Total-Rows                             04270099
      *      When +0                                                    04280099
      *        Add   +1                  To    WS-Excluded-Charges      04290099
      *        Add   -1                  To    WS-No-Read               04300099
      *                                                                 04310099
      *      When +1                                                    04320099
      *        Continue                                                 04330099
      *                                                                 04340099
      *      When other                                                 04350099
      *        Compute                         WS-No-Read               04360099
      *            =                           WS-No-Read               04370099
      *            +                           R115ICR0-Out-Total-Rows  04380099
      *            -                           1                        04390099
      *        End-Compute                                              04400099
      *                                                                 04410099
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 04420099
      *                                                                 04430099
      *    Perform I000-Adjust-Parameters                               04440099
      *    .                                                            04450099
      *################################################################*04460099
      *C620-Read-Next-TF-CR.                                            04470099
      *                                                                 04480099
      *    Set   R115ICR0-In-Get-Next    To    True                     04490099
      *    Perform C630-Call-DBI-TF-CR                                  04500099
      *    .                                                            04510099
      *################################################################*04520099
      *C630-Call-DBI-TF-CR.                                             04530099
      *                                                                 04540099
      *    Call  'F115ICR0'              Using R115ICR0-Sys-Charge-Rel  04550099
      *                                        R7919999-Error-Area      04560099
      *    End-Call                                                     04570099
      *                                                                 04580099
      *    Evaluate True                                                04590099
      *      When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 04600099
      *        Move  'C631'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       04610099
      *        Perform Z900-Abend                                       04620099
      *                                                                 04630099
      *      When R7919999-Return-Error                                 04640099
      *        Continue                                                 04650099
      *                                                                 04660099
      *      When R7919999-Return-OK                                    04670099
      *        Continue                                                 04680099
      *                                                                 04690099
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 04700099
      *    .                                                            04710099
      *################################################################.04720099
       D000-Read-Permissible-Charges.                                   04730099
      *                                                                 04740099
      * Reading the first permissible charge type for the input         04750099
      * operation type.                                                 04760099
      *                                                                 04770099
           Perform C500-Read-Sys-Code-Rel                               04780099
      *                                                                 04790099
      *-1--------------------------------------------------------------*04800099
      *                                                                 04810099
           Perform until R7919999-Return-Error                          04820099
      *                                                                 04830099
             Move  R115ISR0-To-SC-Code   To    WS-In-Charge-Type        04840099
      *                                                                 04850099
      * Reading the first role type permissible for the                 04860099
      * charge type in question.                                        04870099
      *                                                                 04880099
      * NL 0501, Fjerner kall til C600                                  04890099
      *                                                                 04900099
             Perform L100-Read-Sys-Charge-Type                          04910099
      *                                                                 04920099
             Evaluate True also True                                    04930099
               When  R115ICT0-GLACC                                     04940099
               also  Sw-Coll                                            04950099
                   Move 'GLACC'          To    WS-In-Role-Type          04960099
                   Perform D100-Read-By-Paying-Pty                      04970099
               When  R115ICT0-Agent-Pty                                 04980099
               also  Sw-Coll                                            04990099
                   Move '     '          To    WS-In-Role-Type          05000099
                   Perform D100-Read-By-Paying-Pty                      05010099
               When  R115ICT0-Any                                       05020099
               also  Sw-Coll                                            05030099
                   Move 'DRWEE'          To    WS-In-Role-Type          05040099
                   Perform D100-Read-By-Paying-Pty                      05050099
                   Move 'DRWER'          To    WS-In-Role-Type          05060099
                   Perform D100-Read-By-Paying-Pty                      05070099
               When  R115ICT0-Any                                       05080099
               Also Sw-Imp-LC                                           05090099
                   Move 'CUSTM'          To    WS-In-Role-Type          05100099
                   Perform D100-Read-By-Paying-Pty                      05110099
                   Move 'BENEF'          To    WS-In-Role-Type          05120099
                   Perform D100-Read-By-Paying-Pty                      05130099
               When  R115ICT0-Any                                       05140099
               Also Sw-Exp-LC                                           05150099
                   Move 'ISSUI'          To    WS-In-Role-Type          05160099
                   Perform D100-Read-By-Paying-Pty                      05170099
                   Move 'BENEF'          To    WS-In-Role-Type          05180099
                   Perform D100-Read-By-Paying-Pty                      05190099
      *                                                                 05190199
ndl            When  R115ICT0-Any                                       05191099
gar            Also Sw-Gar                                              05192099
                   Move 'CUSTM'          To    WS-In-Role-Type          05193099
                   Perform D100-Read-By-Paying-Pty                      05194099
                   Move 'BENEF'          To    WS-In-Role-Type          05195099
                   Perform D100-Read-By-Paying-Pty                      05196099
      *                                                                 05200099
               When  R115ICT0-Buyer                                     05210099
               also  Sw-Coll                                            05220099
                   Move 'DRWEE'          To    WS-In-Role-Type          05230099
                   Perform D100-Read-By-Paying-Pty                      05240099
               When  R115ICT0-Buyer                                     05250099
               Also Sw-Imp-LC                                           05260099
                   Move 'CUSTM'          To    WS-In-Role-Type          05270099
                   Perform D100-Read-By-Paying-Pty                      05280099
               When  R115ICT0-Buyer                                     05290099
               Also Sw-Exp-LC                                           05300099
                   Move 'ISSUI'          To    WS-In-Role-Type          05310099
                   Perform D100-Read-By-Paying-Pty                      05320099
      *                                                                 05330099
ndl            When  R115ICT0-Buyer                                     05331099
gar            Also Sw-Gar                                              05332099
                   Move 'CUSTM'          To    WS-In-Role-Type          05333099
                   Perform D100-Read-By-Paying-Pty                      05334099
      *                                                                 05335099
               When  R115ICT0-Seller                                    05340099
               also  Sw-Coll                                            05350099
                   Move 'DRWER'          To    WS-In-Role-Type          05360099
                   Perform D100-Read-By-Paying-Pty                      05370099
               When  R115ICT0-Seller                                    05380099
               Also Sw-Imp-LC                                           05390099
                   Move 'BENEF'          To    WS-In-Role-Type          05400099
                   Perform D100-Read-By-Paying-Pty                      05410099
               When  R115ICT0-Seller                                    05420099
               Also Sw-Exp-LC                                           05430099
                   Move 'BENEF'          To    WS-In-Role-Type          05440099
                   Perform D100-Read-By-Paying-Pty                      05450099
      *                                                                 05460099
 ndl           When  R115ICT0-Seller                                    05460199
 gar           Also Sw-Gar                                              05460299
                   Move 'BENEF'          To    WS-In-Role-Type          05460399
                   Perform D100-Read-By-Paying-Pty                      05460499
      *                                                                 05461099
             End-Evaluate                                               05470099
      *                                                                 05480099
             If  R115ICT0-Any                                           05490099
                 Compute                         WS-No-Read             05500099
                     =                           WS-No-Read             05510099
                     +                           1                      05520099
                 End-Compute                                            05530099
                                                                        05540099
             End-If                                                     05550099
                                                                        05560099
             Perform I000-Adjust-Parameters                             05570099
      *                                                                 05580099
      * Reading the next permissible charge type for the input          05590099
      * operation type.                                                 05600099
      *                                                                 05610099
             Perform C520-Read-Next-TF-SR                               05620099
      *                                                                 05630099
           End-Perform                                                  05640099
      *                                                                 05650099
           Initialize                          R7919999-Error           05660099
      *                                                                 05670099
      *-1--------------------------------------------------------------*05680099
           .                                                            05690099
      *                                                                 05700099
      *################################################################.05710099
      *                                                                 05720099
       D100-Read-By-Paying-Pty.                                         05730099
      *                                                                 05740099
               Move  Zero                To    WS-Count-Charges         05750099
      *                                                                 05760099
      * Reading either charges which are registered in connection with  05770099
      * the main contract, or charges which are registered in connection05780099
      * with the part amount.                                           05790099
      *                                                                 05800099
               If R115L060-In-PA-Seq-No    =     +0                     05810099
      * Feilretting ndl 19.10.01                                        05820099
      * When settle ILC or Cancel ILC, and meth of calc is % of PA,     05830099
      * we check if part amount is earlier accepted. If so, We won't    05840099
      * use them again                                                  05850099
      *          If (R115L060-In-Operation-Type = 'SETTLE-ILC'          05860099
      *          Or  R115L060-In-Operation-Type = 'VERIFY-SETTLE-ILC'   05870099
      *          Or  R115L060-In-Operation-Type = 'APPROVE-SETTLE-ILC'  05880099
      *          Or  R115L060-In-Operation-Type = 'EXPIRE-ILC'          05890099
      *          Or  R115L060-In-Operation-Type = 'VERIFY-EXPIRE-ILC'   05900099
      *          Or  R115L060-In-Operation-Type = 'APPROVE-EXPIRE-ILC') 05910099
      *          and R115ICT0-MethCalc-Pct-Of-PA                        05920099
                 If  R115ICT0-MethCalc-Pct-Of-PA                        05930099
                 and R115L060-In-Check-PA > +0                          05940099
      *                                                                 05950099
                    If Sw-PA-Not-Checked                                05960099
                       Perform M110-Check-Part-Amount                   05970099
                    End-If                                              05980099
                    If R7919999-Return-Error                            05990099
                    Or Not R115IPA0-Has-Been-Settled                    06000099
                       Perform E000-Read-Main-Charge                    06010099
                    End-If                                              06020099
                 Else                                                   06030099
      * slutt feilretting                                               06040099
                   Perform E000-Read-Main-Charge                        06050099
               Else                                                     06060099
                 Perform F000-Read-Part-Charge                          06070099
               End-If                                                   06080099
      *                                                                 06090099
      * If no charges of this type are registered, we still want to     06100099
      * display the charge type.                                        06110099
      *                                                                 06120099
               If WS-Count-Charges       =     +0                       06130099
                 Initialize                    WS-Charge                06140099
                 Move  WS-In-Charge-Type To    WS-Charge-Type           06150099
                 Move  WS-In-Role-Type   To    WS-Role-Type             06160099
                 Perform L000-Additional-Info                           06170099
                 Perform J000-Output                                    06180099
               End-If                                                   06190099
      *                                                                 06200099
      *                                                                 06210099
           .                                                            06220099
      *################################################################.06230099
       E000-Read-Main-Charge.                                           06240099
      *                                                                 06250099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*06260099
      * Filling in DBI call parameters.                                 06270099
      *                                                                 06280099
           Initialize                          R115ICH0-Main-Charge     06290099
           Set   R115ICH0-Version        To    True                     06300099
      *                                                                 06310099
           Evaluate True                                                06320099
             When R115L060-In-Actual                                    06330099
               Set R115ICH0-In-Actual    To    True                     06340099
             When R115L060-In-Work                                      06350099
               Set R115ICH0-In-Work      To    True                     06360099
           End-Evaluate                                                 06370099
      *                                                                 06380099
           Move  R115L060-In-Fin-Inst-ID To    R115ICH0-In-Fin-Inst-ID  06390099
           Move  R115L060-In-FIn-Inst-No To    R115ICH0-In-Fin-Inst-No  06400099
      *                                                                 06410099
           Move  R115L060-In-Contract-Type                              06420099
                                         To    R115ICH0-In-Contract-Type06430099
           Move  R115L060-In-Contract-No To    R115ICH0-In-Contract-No  06440099
      *                                                                 06450099
           Move  R115ICA0-Currency       To    R115ICH0-In-CA-Currency  06460099
           Move  +0                      To    R115ICH0-In-PA-Seq-No    06470099
           Move  WS-In-Role-Type         To    R115ICH0-In-RP-Role-Type 06480099
      *                                                                 06490099
           Move  WS-In-Charge-Type       To    R115ICH0-In-Charge-Type  06500099
      *                                                                 06510099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*06520099
      *                                                                 06530099
           Perform E110-Read-1st-TF-CH                                  06540099
      *                                                                 06550099
           Perform E120-Read-Next-TF-CH                                 06560099
             until R7919999-Return-Error                                06570099
           Set     R7919999-Return-OK       To    True                  06580099
           .                                                            06590099
      *################################################################.06600099
       E110-Read-1st-TF-CH.                                             06610099
      *                                                                 06620099
      * Reading the first table row.                                    06630099
      *                                                                 06640099
           Set   R115ICH0-In-Get-1st     To    True                     06650099
           Set   R115ICH0-In-CC-Count    To    True                     06660099
           Perform E130-Call-DBI-TF-CH                                  06670099
      *                                                                 06680099
           If  R115ICH0-Out-Total-Rows   >     +1                       06690099
             Compute                           WS-No-Read               06700099
                 =                             WS-No-Read               06710099
                 +                             R115ICH0-Out-Total-Rows  06720099
                 -                             1                        06730099
             End-Compute                                                06740099
             Perform I000-Adjust-Parameters                             06750099
           End-If                                                       06760099
           .                                                            06770099
      *################################################################.06780099
       E120-Read-Next-TF-CH.                                            06790099
      *                                                                 06800099
           Move R115ICH0-Charge-Type   To    WS-Charge-Type             06810099
           Move R115ICH0-RP-Role-Type  To    WS-Role-Type               06820099
           Move R115ICH0-Charge-Amount To    WS-Charge-Amount           06830099
           Move R115ICH0-Currency      To    WS-Currency                06840099
           Move R115ICH0-Charge-Pct    To    WS-Percent                 06850099
           Move R115ICH0-Charge-Text   To    WS-Charge-Text             06851099
      *                                                                 06860099
           Perform L000-Additional-Info                                 06870099
           Perform J000-Output                                          06880099
      *                                                                 06890099
      * Reading the next table row.                                     06900099
      *                                                                 06910099
           Set   R115ICH0-In-Get-Next    To    True                     06920099
           Perform E130-Call-DBI-TF-CH                                  06930099
           .                                                            06940099
      *################################################################.06950099
       E130-Call-DBI-TF-CH.                                             06960099
      *                                                                 06970099
           Call  'F115ICH0'              Using R115ICH0-Main-Charge     06980099
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      06990099
           End-Call                                                     07000099
      *                                                                 07010099
           Evaluate True                                                07020099
             When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 07030099
               Move  'E131'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       07040099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       07050099
      *                                                                 07060099
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 07070099
               Continue                                                 07080099
      *                                                                 07090099
             When R7919999-Retur-OK                                     07100099
               Move  R115ICH0-Out-Row-No To    WS-Count-Charges         07110099
      *                                                                 07120099
           End-Evaluate                                                 07130099
           .                                                            07140099
      *################################################################.07150099
       F000-Read-Part-Charge.                                           07160099
      *                                                                 07170099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*07180099
      * Filling in the DBI call parameters.                             07190099
      *                                                                 07200099
           Initialize                          R115IPC0-Part-Charge     07210099
           Set   R115IPC0-Version        To    True                     07220099
      *                                                                 07230099
           Evaluate True                                                07240099
             When R115L060-In-Actual                                    07250099
               Set R115IPC0-In-Actual    To    True                     07260099
             When R115L060-In-Work                                      07270099
               Set R115IPC0-In-Work      To    True                     07280099
           End-Evaluate                                                 07290099
      *                                                                 07300099
           Move  R115L060-In-Fin-Inst-ID To    R115IPC0-In-Fin-Inst-ID  07310099
           Move  R115L060-In-Fin-Inst-No To    R115IPC0-In-Fin-Inst-No  07320099
      *                                                                 07330099
           Move  R115L060-In-Contract-Type                              07340099
                                         To    R115IPC0-In-Contract-Type07350099
           Move  R115L060-In-Contract-No To    R115IPC0-In-Contract-No  07360099
      *                                                                 07370099
           Move  R115ICA0-Currency       To    R115IPC0-In-CA-Currency  07380099
           Move  R115L060-In-PA-Seq-No   To    R115IPC0-In-PA-Seq-No    07390099
      *                                                                 07400099
           Move  WS-In-Role-Type         To    R115IPC0-In-Role-Type    07410099
      *                                                                 07420099
           Move  WS-In-Charge-Type       To    R115IPC0-In-CT-Type      07430099
      *                                                                 07440099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*07450099
      *                                                                 07460099
           Perform F110-Read-TF-PC                                      07470099
      *                                                                 07480099
           If R7919999-Return-OK                                        07490099
              Perform F120-Process-TF-PC                                07500099
           End-If                                                       07510099
           .                                                            07520099
      *################################################################.07530099
       F110-Read-TF-PC.                                                 07540099
      *                                                                 07550099
           Set   R115IPC0-In-Select      To    True                     07560099
           Perform F130-Call-DBI-TF-PC                                  07570099
           .                                                            07580099
      *################################################################.07590099
       F120-Process-TF-PC.                                              07600099
      *                                                                 07610099
           Move  R115IPC0-CT-Type        To    WS-Charge-Type           07620099
           Move  R115IPC0-Role-Type      To    WS-Role-Type             07630099
           Move  R115IPC0-Amount         To    WS-Charge-Amount         07640099
           Move  R115IPC0-Currency       To    WS-Currency              07650099
           Move  R115IPC0-Charge-Pct     To    WS-Percent               07660099
           Move  R115IPC0-Charge-Text    To    WS-Charge-Text           07661099
      *                                                                 07670099
           Perform L000-Additional-Info                                 07680099
           Perform J000-Output                                          07690099
           .                                                            07700099
      *################################################################.07710099
       F130-Call-DBI-TF-PC.                                             07720099
      *                                                                 07730099
           Call  'F115IPC0'              Using R115IPC0-Part-Charge     07740099
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      07750099
           End-Call                                                     07760099
      *                                                                 07770099
           Evaluate True                                                07780099
      *                                                                 07790099
             When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 07800099
               Move  'F131'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       07810099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       07820099
      *                                                                 07830099
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 07840099
               Continue                                                 07850099
      *                                                                 07860099
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    07870099
               Add   +1                  To    WS-Count-Charges         07880099
      *                                                                 07890099
           End-Evaluate                                                 07900099
           .                                                            07910099
      *################################################################.07920099
       G000-Read-All-Charges.                                           07930099
      *                                                                 07940099
           Move  +1                      To    WS-No-Read               07950099
           Perform I000-Adjust-Parameters                               07960099
      *                                                                 07970099
           If R115L060-In-PA-Seq-No      =     +0                       07980099
             Perform G100-Read-Main-Charge                              07990099
           Else                                                         08000099
             Perform G200-Read-Part-Charge                              08010099
           End-If                                                       08020099
           .                                                            08030099
      *################################################################*08040099
       G100-Read-Main-Charge.                                           08050099
      *                                                                 08060099
           Initialize                          R115ICH0-Main-Charge     08070099
           Set   R115ICH0-Version        To    True                     08080099
           Set   R115ICH0-In-Actual      To    True                     08090099
      *                                                                 08100099
           Move  R115L060-In-Fin-Inst-ID To    R115ICH0-In-Fin-Inst-ID  08110099
           Move  R115L060-In-FIn-Inst-No To    R115ICH0-In-Fin-Inst-No  08120099
           Move  R115L060-In-Contract-Type                              08130099
                                         To    R115ICH0-In-Contract-Type08140099
           Move  R115L060-In-Contract-No To    R115ICH0-In-Contract-No  08150099
      *                                                                 08160099
           Perform E110-Read-1st-TF-CH                                  08170099
      *                                                                 08180099
           Perform until R7919999-Return-Error                          08190099
             Move  R115ICH0-Charge-Type  To    WS-In-Charge-Type        08200099
             Perform E120-Read-Next-TF-CH                               08210099
           End-Perform                                                  08220099
      *                                                                 08230099
           Set     R7919999-Return-OK    To    True                     08240099
           .                                                            08250099
      *################################################################*08260099
       G200-Read-Part-Charge.                                           08270099
      *                                                                 08280099
           Initialize                          R115IPC0-Part-Charge     08290099
           Set   R115IPC0-Version        To    True                     08300099
           Set   R115IPC0-In-Actual      To    True                     08310099
      *                                                                 08320099
           Move  R115L060-In-Fin-Inst-ID To    R115IPC0-In-Fin-Inst-ID  08330099
           Move  R115L060-In-Fin-Inst-No To    R115IPC0-In-Fin-Inst-No  08340099
           Move  R115L060-In-Contract-Type                              08350099
                                         To    R115IPC0-In-Contract-Type08360099
           Move  R115L060-In-Contract-No To    R115IPC0-In-Contract-No  08370099
      *                                                                 08380099
           Perform G210-Read-1st-TF-PC                                  08390099
      *                                                                 08400099
           Perform until R7919999-Return-Error                          08410099
             Move  R115IPC0-CT-Type      To    WS-In-Charge-Type        08420099
             Perform G220-Read-Next-TF-PC                               08430099
           End-Perform                                                  08440099
      *                                                                 08450099
           Set     R7919999-Return-OK    To    True                     08460099
           .                                                            08470099
      *################################################################*08480099
       G210-Read-1st-TF-PC.                                             08490099
      *                                                                 08500099
           Set   R115IPC0-In-Get-1st     To    True                     08510099
           Set   R115IPC0-In-CC-Count    To    True                     08520099
           Perform F130-Call-DBI-TF-PC                                  08530099
      *                                                                 08540099
           If WS-Count-Charges           >     +1                       08550099
           If R115IPC0-Out-Total-Rows    >     +1                       08560099
             Compute                           WS-No-Read               08570099
                 =                             WS-No-Read               08580099
                 +                             R115ICH0-Out-Total-Rows  08590099
                 -                             1                        08600099
             End-Compute                                                08610099
             Perform I000-Adjust-Parameters                             08620099
           End-If                                                       08630099
           .                                                            08640099
      *################################################################*08650099
       G220-Read-Next-TF-PC.                                            08660099
      *                                                                 08670099
           Perform F120-Process-TF-PC                                   08680099
      *                                                                 08690099
           Set   R115IPC0-In-Get-Next    To    True                     08700099
           Perform F130-Call-DBI-TF-PC                                  08710099
           .                                                            08720099
      *################################################################*08730099
       I000-Adjust-Parameters.                                          08740099
      *                                                                 08750099
      * Setting the Read-From and -To parameters.                       08760099
      *                                                                 08770099
           Evaluate R115L060-In-Read-From                               08780099
           also     R115L060-In-Read-To                                 08790099
      *      ------------------------------------------------------     08800099
             When +0                                                    08810099
             also +0                                                    08820099
      *                                                                 08830099
               Move +1                   To    WS-Read-From             08840099
      *                                                                 08850099
               If  WS-No-Read            >     R115L060-Max-Tab-Occ     08860099
                 Move  R115L060-Max-Tab-Occ                             08870099
                                         To    WS-Read-To               08880099
               Else                                                     08890099
                 Move  WS-No-Read        To    WS-Read-To               08900099
               End-If                                                   08910099
      *      ------------------------------------------------------     08920099
             When any                                                   08930099
             also +0                                                    08940099
      *                                                                 08950099
               Move  R115L060-In-Read-From                              08960099
                                         To    WS-Read-From             08970099
      *                                                                 08980099
               Compute                         WS-Difference            08990099
                   =                           WS-No-Read               09000099
                   -                           WS-Read-From             09010099
               End-Compute                                              09020099
      *                                                                 09030099
               If  WS-Difference         >     R115L060-Max-Tab-Occ     09040099
                 Compute                       WS-Read-To               09050099
                     =                         R115L060-Max-Tab-Occ     09060099
                     +                         WS-Read-From             09070099
                 End-Compute                                            09080099
      *                                                                 09090099
               Else                                                     09100099
                 Compute                       WS-Read-To               09110099
                     =                         WS-Difference            09120099
                     +                         WS-Read-From             09130099
                 End-Compute                                            09140099
               End-If                                                   09150099
      *      ------------------------------------------------------     09160099
             When other                                                 09170099
      *                                                                 09180099
               Move  R115L060-In-Read-From                              09190099
                                         To    WS-Read-From             09200099
               Move  R115L060-In-Read-To                                09210099
                                         To    WS-Read-To               09220099
      *      ------------------------------------------------------     09230099
           End-Evaluate                                                 09240099
      *                                                                 09250099
      * Defining a stop condition.                                      09260099
      *                                                                 09270099
           If  WS-Read-From              >     WS-Read-To               09280099
             Set  R7919999-Return-Error  To    True                     09290099
           End-If                                                       09300099
           .                                                            09310099
      *################################################################*09320099
       J000-Output.                                                     09330099
      *                                                                 09340099
           Add   +1                      To    WS-Count-Rows            09350099
