           If  not WS-Count-Rows         <     WS-Read-From             09390099
           and not WS-Count-Rows         >     WS-Read-To               09400099
      *                                  +     WS-Excluded-Charges )    09410099
               Perform J100-Iter-Output                                 09420099
           End-If                                                       09430099
           .                                                            09440099
