      *################################################################*10190099
       L000-Additional-Info.                                            10200099
      *                                                                 10210099
      *    Perform L100-Read-Sys-Charge-Type                            10220099
      *                                                                 10230099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*10240099
      * 07/08/1999. Prosentsatser skal kun ligge i POP, og aldri        10250099
      * registreres på TFs tabeller. Situasjonen under skal derfor ikke 10260099
      * kunne oppstå.                                                   10270099
      *                                                                 10280099
           If  WS-Charge-Amount          =     Zero                     10290099
           and WS-Percent                not = Zero                     10300099
               Perform N000-Compute-Charge-Amount                       10310099
           End-If                                                       10320099
      *                                                                 10330099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*10340099
      * 19/08/1999. Skal visst ikke regne om allikevel. Derimot skal    10350099
      * valutasorten endres.                                            10360099
      *                                                                 10370099
      *    If  WS-Charge-Amount          not = Zero                     10380099
      *        If  WS-Currency           not = R115ICA0-Currency        10390099
      *            Perform L200-Convert-Amount                          10400099
      *        Else                                                     10410099
      *            Move WS-Charge-Amount To    WS-Converted-Amount      10420099
      *        End-If                                                   10430099
      *    End-If                                                       10440099
      *                                                                 10450099
           Move  WS-Charge-Amount        To    WS-Converted-Amount      10460099
           If  WS-Currency               not = R115ICA0-Currency        10470099
             Move  R115ICA0-Currency     To    WS-Currency              10480099
           End-If                                                       10490099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*10500099
      *                                                                 10510099
      *    If  WS-Converted-Amount       not = Zero                     10520099
      *    If  WS-Percent                    = Zero                     10530099
      *     and (R115ICT0-MethCalc-Pct-Of-CA                            10540099
      *       or R115ICT0-MethCalc-Pct-Of-PA)                           10550099
      *                                                                 10560099
      *    Then                                                         10570099
      *      Perform M000-Compute-Percentage                            10580099
      *                                                                 10590099
      *    End-If                                                       10600099
      *                                                                 10610099
           If  WS-Converted-Amount       not = Zero                     10620099
               Perform L300-Accumulate-Totals                           10630099
           End-If                                                       10640099
      *                                                                 10650099
      *    Remove unneccesary reads of POP                              10660099
           If  R115ICT0-Read-POP-No                                     10670099
               Initialize                      R115L150-TF-POP          10680099
           Else                                                         10690099
               Perform L400-Read-POP                                    10700099
           End-If                                                       10710099
           .                                                            10720099
      *################################################################*10730099
       L100-Read-Sys-Charge-Type.                                       10740099
      *                                                                 10750099
           Initialize                          R115ICT0-Sys-Charge-Type 10760099
           Set   R115ICT0-Version        To    True                     10770099
           Set   R115ICT0-In-Select      To    True                     10780099
      *                                                                 10790099
           Move  R115L060-In-Fin-Inst-ID To    R115ICT0-In-Fin-Inst-Id  10800099
           Move  R115L060-In-Fin-Inst-No To    R115ICT0-In-Fin-Inst-No  10810099
      *                                                                 10820099
           Move  WS-In-Charge-Type       To    R115ICT0-In-CT-Type      10830099
           Move  +0                      To    R115ICT0-In-Regno        10840099
      *                                                                 10850099
           Call  'F115ICT0'              Using R115ICT0-Sys-Charge-Type 10860099
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      10870099
           End-Call                                                     10880099
      *                                                                 10890099
           Evaluate True                                                10900099
             When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 10910099
               Move  'L101'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       10920099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       10930099
      *                                                                 10940099
      *      When R7919999-Return-Error                                 10950099
      *        Move  'L102'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       10960099
      *        Perform Z700-Error-AE                                    10970099
      *                                                                 10980099
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 10990099
      *                                                                 11000099
      *      20.09.01                                                   11010099
      *      Leser med regno                                            11020099
      *                                                                 11030099
                 Set  R7919999-Return-OK To    True                     11040099
                 Move  R115L060-In-Reg-No                               11050099
                                         To    R115ICT0-In-Regno        11060099
      *                                                                 11070099
                 Call  'F115ICT0'       Using R115ICT0-Sys-Charge-Type  11080099
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      11090099
                 End-Call                                               11100099
      *                                                                 11110099
                 Evaluate True                                          11120099
                   When R7919999-Return-Abend                           11130099
                     Move  'L102'        To    R7919999-Paragraph       11140099
                     Perform Z900-Abend                                 11150099
      *                                                                 11160099
                   When R7919999-Return-Error                           11170099
                     Move  'L103'        To    R7919999-Paragraph       11180099
                     Perform Z700-Error-AE                              11190099
      *                                                                 11200099
                 End-Evaluate                                           11210099
      *                                                                 11220099
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    11230099
               Continue                                                 11240099
      *                                                                 11250099
           End-Evaluate                                                 11260099
           .                                                            11270099
      *################################################################*11280099
       L200-Convert-Amount.                                             11290099
      *                                                                 11300099
           Initialize                          R116L030-Currency-Xchange11310099
           Set   R116L030-Version        To    True                     11320099
      *                                                                 11330099
           Move  WS-Currency             To    R116L030-In-From-Currency11340099
           Move  R115ICA0-Currency       To    R116L030-In-To-Currency  11350099
           Move  WS-Charge-Amount        To    R116L030-In-From-Amount  11360099
           Move  R115L060-In-Fin-Inst-No(1:4)                           11370099
                                         To    R116L030-In-Fin-Inst-No  11380099
      *                                                                 11390099
           Perform L230-Call-LMOD-Convert-Amount                        11400099
           Move  R116L030-To-Amount      To   WS-Converted-Amount       11410099
           Move  R116L030-To-Currency    To    WS-Currency              11420099
           .                                                            11430099
      *################################################################*11440099
       L230-Call-LMOD-Convert-Amount.                                   11450099
      *                                                                 11460099
           Call  'F116L030'              Using R116L030-Currency-Xchange11470099
                                               R7919999-Error           11480099
           End-Call                                                     11490099
      *                                                                 11500099
           Evaluate True                                                11510099
             When R7919999-Retur-Abend                                  11520099
               Move  'L231'              To    R7919999-Paragraf        11530099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       11540099
      *                                                                 11550099
             When R7919999-Retur-Feil                                   11560099
               Move  'L232'              To    R7919999-Paragraf        11570099
               Perform Z700-Error-AE                                    11580099
      *                                                                 11590099
             When R7919999-Retur-OK                                     11600099
               Continue                                                 11610099
      *                                                                 11620099
           End-Evaluate                                                 11630099
           .                                                            11640099
      *################################################################*11650099
       L300-Accumulate-Totals.                                          11660099
      *                                                                 11670099
      * Accumulating sums per paying party and per paid party.          11680099
      *                                                                 11690099
           Evaluate True also True                                      11700099
      *      When  Ws-Seller                                            11710099
             When  Ws-Agent                                             11720099
             also  R115ICT0-Agent                                       11730099
               Add   WS-Converted-Amount                                11740099
      *                                  To    WS-Ch-Seller-Cred-Agent  11750099
                                         To    WS-Tot-Agent-Commission  11760099
      *                                                                 11770099
             When  WS-Seller                                            11780099
             also  R115ICT0-Other-Bank                                  11790099
               Add   WS-Converted-Amount                                11800099
                                         To    WS-Ch-Seller-Cred-T-Bank 11810099
      *                                                                 11820099
             When  WS-Seller                                            11830099
             also  R115ICT0-Own-Bank                                    11840099
               Add   WS-Converted-Amount                                11850099
                                         To    WS-Ch-Seller-Cred-W-Bank 11860099
      *                                                                 11870099
      *      When  WS-Buyer                                             11880099
      *      also  R115ICT0-Agent                                       11890099
      *        Add   WS-Converted-Amount                                11900099
      *                                  To    WS-Ch-Buyer-Cred-Agent   11910099
      *                                                                 11920099
             When  WS-Buyer                                             11930099
             also  R115ICT0-Other-Bank                                  11940099
               Add  WS-Converted-Amount                                 11950099
                                         To    WS-Ch-Buyer-Cred-T-Bank  11960099
      *                                                                 11970099
             When  WS-Buyer                                             11980099
             also  R115ICT0-Own-Bank                                    11990099
               Add   WS-Converted-Amount                                12000099
                                         To    WS-Ch-Buyer-Cred-W-Bank  12010099
      *                                                                 12020099
           End-Evaluate                                                 12030099
      *                                                                 12040099
      * Computing grand totals.                                         12050099
      *                                                                 12060099
           Compute                             WS-Tot-Charge-Seller     12070099
      *        =                               WS-Ch-Seller-Cred-Agent  12080099
      *        +                               WS-Ch-Seller-Cred-T-Bank 12090099
               =                               WS-Ch-Seller-Cred-T-Bank 12100099
               +                               WS-Ch-Seller-Cred-W-Bank 12110099
           End-Compute                                                  12120099
      *                                                                 12130099
           Compute                             WS-Tot-Charge-Buyer      12140099
      *        =                               WS-Ch-Buyer-Cred-Agent   12150099
      *        +                               WS-Ch-Buyer-Cred-T-Bank  12160099
               =                               WS-Ch-Buyer-Cred-T-Bank  12170099
               +                               WS-Ch-Buyer-Cred-W-Bank  12180099
           End-Compute                                                  12190099
      *                                                                 12200099
      *    Compute                             WS-Tot-Agent-Commission  12210099
      *        =                               WS-Ch-Seller-Cred-Agent  12220099
      *        +                               WS-Ch-Buyer-Cred-Agent   12230099
      *    End-Compute                                                  12240099
           .                                                            12250099
      *################################################################.12260099
       L400-Read-POP.                                                   12270099
      *                                                                 12280099
           Initialize                         R115L150-TF-POP           12290099
           Set   R115L150-Version        To   True                      12300099
      *                                                                 12310099
           Evaluate True                                                12320099
             When R115L060-In-Actual                                    12330099
               Set   R115L150-In-Actual  To   True                      12340099
             When R115L060-In-Work                                      12350099
               Set   R115L150-In-Work    To   True                      12360099
           End-Evaluate                                                 12370099
      *                                                                 12380099
           Move  R115L060-In-Fin-Inst-ID To   R115L150-In-Fin-Inst-ID   12390099
           Move  R115L060-In-Fin-Inst-No To   R115L150-In-Fin-Inst-No   12400099
           Move  R115L060-In-Reg-No      To   R115L150-In-Reg-No        12410099
      *                                                                 12420099
           Move  R115L060-In-Contract-Type                              12430099
                                         To   R115L150-In-Contract-Type 12440099
           Move  R115L060-In-Contract-No To   R115L150-In-Contract-No   12450099
           Move  R115L060-In-PA-Seq-No   To   R115L150-In-Part-Amount-No12460099
           Move  WS-In-Charge-Type       To   R115L150-In-Charge-Type   12470099
           Move  R7919070-Ut-Dato        To   R115L150-In-Valid-Date    12480099
      *                                                                 12490099
           Call  'F115L150'              Using R115L150-TF-POP          12500099
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      12510099
           End-Call                                                     12520099
      *                                                                 12530099
           Evaluate True                                                12540099
             When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 12550099
               Move  'L401'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       12560099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       12570099
      *                                                                 12580099
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 12590099
               Move  'L402'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       12600099
               Perform Z700-Error-AE                                    12610099
                                                                        12620099
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    12630099
               Continue                                                 12640099
                                                                        12650099
           End-Evaluate                                                 12660099
           .                                                            12670099
      *################################################################*12680099
      *M000-Compute-Percentage.                                         12690099
      *                                                                 12700099
      * Not in USE (NDL)                                                12710099
      * The percentage is calculated either from the Contract Amount,   12720099
      * or from the Part Amount.                                        12730099
      *                                                                 12740099
      *                                                                 12750099
      *    Evaluate True                                                12760099
      *      When R115ICT0-MethCalc-Pct-Of-CA                           12770099
      *        Move  R115ICA0-Remaining-Amount                          12780099
      * Feilretting NDL, beløp hentes fra curr-original amount          12790099
      *        Move  R115ICA0-Curr-O-Amount                             12800099
      *                                  To    WS-CA-Or-PA-Amount       12810099
      *                                                                 12820099
      *      When R115ICT0-MethCalc-Pct-Of-PA                           12830099
      *        If R115L060-In-PA-Seq-No  not = Zero                     12840099
      *           Perform M100-Read-Part-Amount                         12850099
      *           Move  R115IPA0-Amount  To    WS-CA-Or-PA-Amount       12860099
      *        Else                                                     12870099
      *           Move  R115ICA0-Remaining-Amount                       12880099
      * Feilretting NDL, beløp hentes fra curr-original amount          12890099
      *           Move  R115ICA0-Curr-O-Amount                          12900099
      *                                  To    WS-CA-Or-PA-Amount       12910099
      *        End-If                                                   12920099
      *                                                                 12930099
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 12940099
      *                                                                 12950099
      *    If  not WS-CA-Or-PA-Amount    =     Zero                     12960099
      *                                                                 12970099
      *        Compute                         WS-Percent               12980099
      *            =                           WS-Charge-Amount         12990099
      *            /                           WS-CA-Or-PA-Amount       13000099
      *            *                           100                      13010099
      *        End-Compute                                              13020099
      *                                                                 13030099
      *    Else                                                         13040099
      *                                                                 13050099
      *        Move  Zero                To    WS-Percent               13060099
      *                                                                 13070099
      *    End-If                                                       13080099
      *    .                                                            13090099
      *################################################################*13100099
       N000-Compute-Charge-Amount.                                      13110099
      *                                                                 13120099
      * The charges is calculated either from the Contract Amount,      13130099
      * or from the Part Amount.                                        13140099
      *                                                                 13150099
           Evaluate True                                                13160099
             When R115ICT0-MethCalc-Pct-Of-CA                           13170099
      *        Move  R115ICA0-Remaining-Amount                          13180099
      * Feilretting NDL, beløp hentes fra curr-original amount          13190099
               Move  R115ICA0-Curr-O-Amount                             13200099
                                         To    WS-CA-Or-PA-Amount       13210099
      *                                                                 13220099
             When R115ICT0-MethCalc-Pct-Of-PA                           13230099
               If R115L060-In-PA-Seq-No  not = Zero                     13240099
                  Perform M100-Read-Part-Amount                         13250099
                  Move  R115IPA0-Amount  To    WS-CA-Or-PA-Amount       13260099
               Else                                                     13270099
      *           Move  R115ICA0-Remaining-Amount                       13280099
      * Feilretting NDL, beløp hentes fra curr-original amount          13290099
                  Move  R115ICA0-Curr-O-Amount                          13300099
                                         To    WS-CA-Or-PA-Amount       13310099
               End-If                                                   13320099
      *                                                                 13330099
           End-Evaluate                                                 13340099
      *                                                                 13350099
           If  not WS-CA-Or-PA-Amount    =     Zero                     13360099
      *                                                                 13370099
               Compute                         WS-Charge-Amount         13380099
               Rounded                                                  13390099
                   =                           WS-CA-Or-PA-Amount       13400099
                   *                           WS-Percent               13410099
                   /                           100                      13420099
               End-Compute                                              13430099
      *                                                                 13440099
           Else                                                         13450099
      *                                                                 13460099
               Move  Zero                To    WS-Charge-Amount         13470099
      *                                                                 13480099
           End-If                                                       13490099
      *                                                                 13500099
           .                                                            13510099
      *################################################################*13520099
       M100-Read-Part-Amount.                                           13530099
      *                                                                 13540099
           Initialize                          R115IPA0-Part-Amount     13550099
           Set   R115IPA0-Version        To    True                     13560099
           Set   R115IPA0-In-Select      To    True                     13570099
                                                                        13580099
           Evaluate True                                                13590099
             When R115L060-In-Actual                                    13600099
               Set   R115IPA0-In-Actual  To    True                     13610099
                                                                        13620099
             When R115L060-In-Work                                      13630099
               Set   R115IPA0-In-Work    To    True                     13640099
                                                                        13650099
           End-Evaluate                                                 13660099
      *                                                                 13670099
           Move  R115L060-In-Fin-Inst-No                                13680099
                                         To    R115IPA0-In-Fin-Inst-No  13690099
      *                                                                 13700099
           Move  R115L060-In-Contract-Type                              13710099
                                         To    R115IPA0-In-Contract-Type13720099
           Move  R115L060-In-Contract-No To    R115IPA0-In-Contract-No  13730099
                                                                        13740099
           Move  R115ICA0-Currency       To    R115IPA0-In-CA-Currency  13750099
           Move  R115L060-In-PA-Seq-No   To    R115IPA0-In-PA-Seq-No    13760099
      *                                                                 13770099
           Call  'F115IPA0'              Using R115IPA0-Part-Amount     13780099
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      13790099
           End-Call                                                     13800099
      *                                                                 13810099
           Evaluate True                                                13820099
             When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 13830099
               Move  'M101'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       13840099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       13850099
      *                                                                 13860099
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 13870099
               Move  'M102'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       13880099
               Perform Z700-Error-AE                                    13890099
      *                                                                 13900099
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    13910099
               Continue                                                 13920099
      *                                                                 13930099
           End-Evaluate                                                 13940099
           .                                                            13950099
      *################################################################*13960099
       M110-Check-Part-Amount.                                          13970099
      *                                                                 13980099
           Initialize                          R115IPA0-Part-Amount     13990099
           Set   R115IPA0-Version        To    True                     14000099
           Set   R115IPA0-In-Select      To    True                     14010099
