      *################################################################*14280099
       ZI00-Konv-Input-Version.                                         14290099
      *                                                                 14300099
      * Version control.                                                14310099
      * If conversion is needed, we call the conversion module.         14320099
      *                                                                 14330099
           Set   R115L060-Version        To    True                     14340099
           Move  Length                  Of    R115L060-Comp-Charge     14350099
                                         To    W-IO-Length              14360099
      *                                                                 14370099
           Evaluate True                                                14380099
             When L-Ext-IO-Area (1:8)    =     R115L060-Version-No      14390099
             and  Length                 Of    L-Ext-IO-Area            14400099
                                         Not < W-IO-Length              14410099
               Move  L-Ext-IO-Area (1:W-IO-Length)                      14420099
                                         To    W-Int-IO-Area            14430099
      *                                                                 14440099
             When Other                                                 14450099
               Call  'F115L999'                                         14460099
                   Using By Content      'F115L060 '                    14470099
                                         'INPUT '                       14480099
                         By Reference    L-Ext-IO-Area                  14490099
                                         W-Int-IO-Area                  14500099
                                         R7919999-Error-Area            14510099
               End-Call                                                 14520099
      *                                                                 14530099
               If  R7919999-Return-Abend                                14540099
                   Move  'ZI01'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       14550099
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   14560099
               End-If                                                   14570099
      *                                                                 14580099
           End-Evaluate                                                 14590099
           .                                                            14600099
